IBM and Hitachi sell a complete OSF/1 for their mainframes. Kendall Square Research
also sells a complete OSF/1 for their platform.

IMHO the main contribution of OSF/1 has been to legitimize and popularize the
idea of microkernel-based operating systems.

: >----------------------------------------------------------------------------<
: |OSF/Motif Is this still OSF?  Or has COSE, X/Open somehow
: |	taken control?
: >----------------------------------------------------------------------------<
:     Last I heard, the X consortium was taking over Motif, but I don't know the
